      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3Ae25d94d0-bd50-4c2c-906c-14cdf85801fb",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>This was resolved by treating http<span class=\"error\">&#91;s&#93;</span>://local.fedora.server/fedora as a special replacement variable itself, so when the Fedora server sees it, it translates it to http<span class=\"error\">&#91;s&#93;</span>://actualHost:actualPort/actualContext when necessary</p>\n\n<p>Demo objects were updated accordingly.</p>",
     "created": "08/May/09 7:42 PM",
